# CR 702.16e: Serra's Emissary's `Affected$ You,Creature.YouCtrl |
# AddKeyword$ Protection:ChosenType` becomes `Protection:Instant`
# (layerSubstituteKeyword) on its controller too. A bare card-type
# characteristic matches the source card by type, so the Instant Lightning
# Bolt cannot hit human; the CR 608.2b re-check fizzles it.
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 2 R
queue targets human
queue action ai cast 3
passpriority
